composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.1994070Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.1994449Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.1995511Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.1996218Z    if you are ready to continue.
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.1996710Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.1997236Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.1998209Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.1999000Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.1999520Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.1999779Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.1999991Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2000439Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2000690Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2001178Z    can use Nix.
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2001371Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2001661Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2002238Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2002769Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2003413Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2003989Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2004164Z I will:
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2004386Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2004622Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2005409Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2006432Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2007010Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2007553Z  - install Nix in /nix
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2007966Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2008534Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2009146Z    /root
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2016736Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2017554Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2027030Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2028537Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2029177Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2029567Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mReady to continue?
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2030152Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2046640Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2047770Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2056588Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2057440Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2058274Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2066314Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2066904Z   $ curl -L https://nixos.org/nix/install | sh
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2067538Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2067786Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2068332Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2068577Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2068900Z If you would like to
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2069274Z see the output, try like this:
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2069495Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2069745Z   $ curl -L -o install-nix https://nixos.org/nix/install
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2070391Z   $ sh ./install-nix
composition-native (ubuntu-24.04-arm)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:09.2070673Z 
