composition-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:24.8590490Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
composition-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:24.8591085Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
composition-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:24.8591728Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:24.8592244Z I will:
composition-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:24.8592657Z 
composition-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:24.8594121Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
composition-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:24.8594983Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
composition-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:24.8595552Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
composition-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:24.8595993Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
composition-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:24.8596324Z  - install Nix in /nix
composition-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:24.8596630Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
composition-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:24.8597065Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
composition-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:24.8597512Z    /root
composition-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:24.8609126Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
composition-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:24.8609964Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
composition-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:24.8621552Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
composition-native (ubuntu-latest)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-11-06T03:05:24.8622237Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
